# Stable spec ID: iba-chartreuse-swizzle. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(herbal liqueur @ Green Chartreuse) 45 ml
(pineapple juice, fresh) 30 ml
(lime: juice, fresh) 22.5 ml
(falernum) 15 ml

::equipment
(tall glass)
(swizzle stick)
(cocktail spoon)
(mixing tool) = (swizzle stick) -OR- (cocktail spoon)

::instructions
<add, all measured ingredients and pebble ice to (tall glass)>
<swizzle, vigorously using (mixing tool)>
<fill, glass with more pebble ice>
<garnish, with mint leaves and grated nutmeg>

::notes
